{"id":"0ebe4cc69bec","path":"/en/university/info/research-service/funding-opportunities/for-companies","lang":"en","title":"For companies","description":"The primary role of Euresearch is to facilitate access to European funding and collaboration opportunities for Ticino based entities interested in participating in European research and innovation programs.","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","Research Service","Funding opportunities"],"image":null,"words":111,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/servizio-ricerca/funding-opportunities/for-companies","en":"/en/university/info/research-service/funding-opportunities/for-companies"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"Research Service","path":"/en/university/info/research-service"},{"label":"Funding opportunities","path":"/en/node/10511"},{"label":"For companies","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>The primary role of <a href=\"https://www.euresearch.ch/\">Euresearch </a>is to facilitate access to European funding and collaboration opportunities for Ticino based entities interested in participating in European research and innovation programs. Our company advisor main functions:</p> <ul> <li>Provide support to companies in exploring funding opportunities.</li> <li>Help identify the most relevant calls based on topics or the funding goals of the company.</li> <li>Assist companies in understanding the requirements and eligibility conditions for funding opportunities.</li> <li>Advise companies on budgeting and best practices in consortia structuring.</li> </ul> <p>If you are interested, have a look at:</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"/it/feeds/30463\">Innosuisse funding for international projects</a></li> <li><a href=\"/it/feeds/30464\">Innosuisse funding projects with implementation partner</a></li> <li><a href=\"/it/feeds/30465\">Eurostars projects</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://www.startup.usi.ch/en\">USI Startup Center</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer\">USI Transfer</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>Contact</strong></p> <p>Company Advisors Euresearch, <a href=\"mailto:servizio.ricerca@usi.ch\">Marcello Triulzio</a></p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Research support","href":"/en/university/info/research-service"},{"label":"Open Calls","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/current-opportunities/open-calls"},{"label":"Rolling Calls","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/current-opportunities/rolling-calls"},{"label":"Events","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/current-opportunities/events"},{"label":"News","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/current-opportunities/news"},{"label":"Newsletter","href":"https://newsletter.usi.ch/ns_published/en/110"},{"label":"Competitive Foundations","href":"/en/university/info/research-servicet/funding-opportunities/competitive-foundations"},{"label":"Fondo Istituzionale per la Ricerca (FIR)","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/funding-opportunities/fondo-istituzionale-ricerca"},{"label":"Call for projects on Open Science and Open Research Data","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/funding-opportunities/call-projects-open-science-open-research-data"},{"label":"For PhD students","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/funding-opportunities/phd-students"},{"label":"For Postdocs","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/funding-opportunities/postdocs"},{"label":"For experienced researchers","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/funding-opportunities/experienced-researchers"},{"label":"For companies","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/funding-opportunities/for-companies"},{"label":"Application preparation","href":"/en/node/10506"},{"label":"RDM and ORD resources","href":"/en/university/info/research-service/research-data-management/rdm-ord-resources"},{"label":"Storing and sharing data","href":"/en/university/info/resear